  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ay34bGO.png\" alt=\"Thaumic Tinkerer Logo\" width=\"1800\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p>Thaumic Tinkerer 现已支持 1.12 版本！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>目前仍处于 Alpha 测试阶段。截至目前，仅重新添加了少量物品。</p>\n<p>我们现在有了 Discord 社区！<a href=\"https://discord.gg/wdK3GfN37m\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里加入！</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/E8fm2ah.png?1\" alt=\"Essentia funnel in action\" width=\"1913\" height=\"1034\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BmVlbUSnQhY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>以及</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/abnwApHwdJQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>位移焦点效果：</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XpIrCtVj3i0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在可预见的未来，我计划每天大约添加一个方块或物品，并每周发布一次更新，希望直到模组完全重建完成。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>即将添加的内容：</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vIPcEA5EPHE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>气动附魔台初版</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qX_t43G8beY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=82040\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/logo/become_a_patron_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"51\"></a></p>",
